cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this firmware, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Battery-Free Wireless Torque Sensor (BWST): Demo Firmware"
abstract: >-
  Firmware for a battery-free wireless torque-sensing platform based on the
  Texas Instruments CC430F5137. It contains a sensor node that samples a
  strain-gauge bridge and transmits the reading over a sub-1 GHz radio link,
  and a receiver node that forwards the received value over UART.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Li
    given-names: Pengyu
    affiliation: "STVLAb, City University of Hong Kong"
year: 2023
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/plxxch/battery-free-wireless-torque-sensor"
keywords:
  - battery-free
  - wireless sensor
  - torque sensor
  - strain gauge
  - CC430F5137
  - MSP430
